{"articleNo":"236038","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=236038&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2020학년도 대학생 청소년 교육지원장학금 장학생(멘토) 선발결과 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.03.26","hit":"6264","attachments":[{"name":"2020학년도 대학생 청소년교육지원사업 안내 자료(대학 공지용).pptx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=236038&attachNo=87228"},{"name":"기관등록 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=236038&attachNo=87229"},{"name":"멘토 활동계획서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=236038&attachNo=87230"},{"name":"2020년 대학생 청소년 교육지원장학금 멘토 시스템 메뉴얼.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=236038&attachNo=87231"},{"name":"2020년도 대학생 청소년교육지원사업 기관포털 매뉴얼.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=236038&attachNo=87232"},{"name":"2020년도 대학생 청소년교육지원사업 수요조사 결과.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=236038&attachNo=87234"},{"name":"2019년 대학생 청소년교육지원사업 활동 기관.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=236038&attachNo=87235"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2020학년도 대학생 청소년 교육지원사업 장학생(멘토) 선발결과 알림</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">★ 학적변동자(휴학, 제적, 졸업 등)는 사업 참여가 제한됩니다.[장학금 지급불가]</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">★ 부정근로 및 허위 서류 제출자는 사업 참여가 제한됩니다.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; [게시 글의 유의 사항 및 첨부자료 반드시 확인]</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">★ 해외출입국 기간에는 출근부 등록이 제한됩니다.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">★ 공지 내용은 한국장학재단 업무처리기준에 따라 변경될 수 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">★ </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">코로나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">19 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">확산 방지를 위하여 감염병 위기 경보 수준이 낮아지고 안정화 된 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">멘토 활동 시행 </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">★</span></font></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">1. 활동기간 : 활동 기관 배정 등 완료 후 ~ 2021.1.31.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2. 선발자 통보방법</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - 선발자에 한해 개별 통보</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - 대학 자체 선발기준 : 1순위 기 사업 참여자, 2순위 저학년&gt;고학년, 3순위 성적 상위자</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">3. 장학금 지급일 : 활동 다음달 20일 지급 </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">4. 활동 신청 및 승인</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - 시간표 입력-대학 추천-기관등록신청서 제출(미등록 기관만)-활동계획서 업로드-기관 배정-멘토 활동</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">5. 출근부 입력 관련</span><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">가. 출근부는 활동 후 반드시 3일 이내(활동일 포함 3일)로 입력하여야 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →1일 최대 8시간, 주당 최대 20시간(학기중)/주당 최대 40시간(방학중), 학기당 최대 450시간</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →분 단위 활동에 대해서는 인정되지 않음</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →연 10시간 미만의 활동에 대해서는 인정되지 않음</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →예산 사정 등에 따라 활동시간은 제한될 수 있음&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">나. 수업 시간표 등록시간 및 활동 장소로 이동하는 시간에는 출근부 입력이 불가능합니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">6. 유의사항</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">가. 사전 OT 알림</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 일시 :&nbsp;&nbsp;등교일 이후(개별적으로)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 장소 : 본관 1층 학생처</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 사업관련 안내자료 배부 및 제출자료 등 관련사항 안내</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">- 기관등록 신청 및 활동계획서도 등교일 이후 선정</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">나. 수업시간 및 해외체류기간에는 출근부 입력 금지</span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">다. 재학 중인 경우에만 근로를 할 수 있으므로, 학적이 변동될 경우 근로 불가능</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">라. 부정근로로 적발된 경우 근로 참여 제한</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ⊙ 허위근로 : 근로를 하지 않고 출근부를 입력한 경우</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; → 근로 중단, 장학금 환수 및 확정시점의 다음학기부터 4개 학기 참여 제한</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,s